error[elab/latex-outside-hint-unsupported]: LaTeX literals are not allowed outside a hint
  ┌─ elab/type-latex-outside-hint.watsup:5:10
  │
4 │ dec $f : nat
  │          --- return value of function '$f' expects 'nat'
5 │ def $f = %latex("hello")
  │          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  │
  = A `%latex("...")` literal embeds raw LaTeX only inside a hint.

